      <data key="e_source_url">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alexander_Graf_Lambsdorff</data>
      <data key="e_quote">&amp;#91; 4 &amp;#93; In 2010, he joined the Friends of the EEAS , an unofficial and independent pressure group formed because of concerns that the High Representative of the Union for Foreign Affairs and Security Policy Catherine Ashton was not paying sufficient attention to the Parliament and was sharing too little information on the formation of the European External Action Service .</data>
    </edge>
