      <data key="e_quote">German politician (born 1966)        Alexander Sebastian Léonce von der Wenge Graf Lambsdorff &amp;#91; a &amp;#93; (born 5 November 1966), commonly known as Alexander Graf Lambsdorff is a German politician of the Free Democratic Party of Germany (FDP), part of the Alliance of Liberals and Democrats for Europe , &amp;#91; 1 &amp;#93; who has been serving as the German ambassador to Russia since 2023.</data>
    </edge>
