      <data key="e_source_url">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eugen_Tomac</data>
      <data key="e_quote">He is also member of several delegations of the European Parliament: the Delegation to the Euronest Parliamentary Assembly, the Delegation for relations with Serbia. and the Delegation for Relations with South Caucasus. &amp;#91; 5 &amp;#93;   As a Member of the European Parliament, his activities centre around the Eastern Partnership dimension and the Balkans, as well as democracy, rule of law, human rights, employment and social policies, children’s rights, the protection of the Romanian diaspora, and the rights of the Romanian minority in the world.</data>
