      <data key="e_quote">Finally she urged Turkey to enforce copyrights effectively and so to stop brand piracy . &amp;#91; 11 &amp;#93; Quisthoudt-Rowohl holds the European ban on incandescent lamps for patronizing and undemocratic, because the parliament and the public were not involved. &amp;#91; 12 &amp;#93; Ms Quisthoudt-Rowohl was also involved in the ceilings for the mobile phone fees in the EU. &amp;#91; 13 &amp;#93;   She wants to strengthen small and medium enterprises (SMEs) by increasing participation in international trade and by an intensification of relations to the USA. &amp;#91; 12 &amp;#93; She was involved in a new energy agreement between Russia and the EU. &amp;#91; 14 &amp;#93; &amp;#91; 15 &amp;#93;   Quisthoudt-Rowohl was formally a member of the Committee on Development .</data>
