      <data key="e_quote">Dutch politician (born 1950)   Ria Oomen-Ruijten   Ria Oomen-Ruijten (born 6 September 1950 in Echt , Limburg ) is a Dutch politician of the Christian Democratic Appeal (CDA) who has been serving as a member of the Senate since 9 June 2015.</data>
    </edge>
