      <data key="e_quote">Séjourné was active in student politics within the National Union of Students of France (UNEF) and the Young Socialists, he took part in the blockade of the University of Poitiers and in the occupation of MEDEF premises in 2006, during the social movement against the First Employment Contract (CPE).</data>
    </edge>
    <edge id="e3406" source="stephane-sejourne" target="national-union-of-students-of-france-unef">
